{
  "info": {
    "name": "ServiceControl API",
    "_postman_id": "3f8b2e7a-1c4d-4a5e-9f0b-6d2c8e9a1b4f",
    "description": "Collection da API ServiceControl (NestJS + JWT).\n\nComo usar:\n- Variavel `baseUrl` aponta para a API (default http://localhost:1511).\n- Execute `Login` primeiro. No Postman, o script de teste captura automaticamente `token` e `companyId` (collection variables).\n- No Insomnia: importe este arquivo (Collection v2), execute o `Login` e copie o `accessToken` para a variavel de ambiente global `token`.\n- Endpoints protegidos usam `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`; o tenant e definido pelo JWT (nunca enviar companyId no body).\n- Substantivos de caminho: /companies, /users, /positions, /branches, /employees (sem prefixo /api).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:1511" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "companyId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "positionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "branchId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "employeeId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('companyId', pm.response.json().user.companyId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@servicecontrol.com.br\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
